<section image-layout="blank" id="bm0g7mX2-a" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="x9B_gsFsnz"><h2>Value is connected—not automatic</h2><p font-size="17pt">The ritual serves guests, staff, and the property only if the pilot proves the chain from interest to contribution.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="T9mfhzC_fd" colspan="32"><p role="eyebrow">Who should benefit</p><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="aTHZhMVBMp" cell-style="subtle" padding="10pt 14pt"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="17" vertical-align="center"><h4>Guests</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="43" vertical-align="center"><p font-size="16pt">A low-friction pause without arranging an off-property appointment or clinical treatment.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="k8Fso9l5aF" cell-style="subtle" padding="10pt 14pt"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="17" vertical-align="center"><h4>Staff</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="43" vertical-align="center"><p font-size="16pt">A defined offer, booking script, capacity limit, and practitioner handoff.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="uR1xLfz0S4" cell-style="subtle" padding="10pt 14pt"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="17" vertical-align="center"><h4>The property</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="43" vertical-align="center"><p font-size="16pt">A distinctive guest story with a testable ancillary charge or package allocation.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="3v_EMMNfqQ" colspan="28"><p role="eyebrow">What the pilot must prove</p><grid divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" marker-size="small" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 26pt; --marker-gap: 8pt;"><grid-item id="0NejcFllLB" colspan="30" padding="8pt 10pt"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Guest interest.</b> The offer is understood and wanted.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="itV5ckFDXf" colspan="30" padding="8pt 10pt"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Bookings.</b> Interest converts into attended places.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ZcqOobvfDD" colspan="30" padding="8pt 10pt"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Manageable operation.</b> Handoffs, capacity, and room turns stay controlled.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="uFkdCwUMop" colspan="30" padding="8pt 10pt"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Positive contribution.</b> Revenue exceeds the direct costs included in the agreed model.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><p font-size="16pt"><b>Decision principle:</b> measure the chain; do not assume the outcome.</p></grid-item></grid></section>